const ownerSection=()=>"<section class=\"owner-intro\" id=\"about-owner\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">The Neighbor’s Travel Guide / Move fast. Break the peace.</div><h1>The tech-bro / <span class=\"headline-phrase\">frat-bro guide</span> to investing <span class=\"headline-phrase\">Mom &amp; Dad’s money.</span></h1><p class=\"intro\">Disrupt the neighborhood. Scale the portfolio. Send Mom &amp; Dad the pitch deck. An unauthorized, satirical owner’s manual inspired by Patrick Forelli’s own forum posts.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"#forum-files\">Read the forum files ↓</a><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"#facebook-album\">Visit the photo album ↓</a><p class=\"source\">About the owner · An independent parody. The tech-bro / frat-bro persona is our caricature; quotes are sourced and punchlines are ours.</p></section><section id=\"forum-files\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">The investor origin story</div><h2>Bigger pockets.<br>Longer footnotes.</h2><p class=\"intro\">A self-guided tour of financing questions, family capital, and a credit report with a plot twist.</p><p class=\"note\">Excerpts attributed to Patrick Forelli’s BiggerPockets account in the supplied pages saved October 17, 2026. Quoted wording is preserved; separate excerpts omit intervening text. The commentary is original satire. Historical posts describe the author’s claims and proposals, not independently verified outcomes.</p><div class=\"owner-stories\"><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 01 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>The damage deposit gets a sequel.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>A five-star getaway for the credit score: check in at 740, check out at 640. The souvenir apparently stayed longer than the guests.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180531-remove-collections-from-credit-report\"><p>“I want to buy another one but my credit score recently tanked due to a collections filing from a property I rented.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180531-remove-collections-from-credit-report\"><p>“I have since paid the collections.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180531-remove-collections-from-credit-report\"><p>“I rented a property with a few friends for a year and after move out we were charged with over 6000 $ in B.S damages including 5k to repaint all the interior walls of the home due to a few minor marks.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180531-remove-collections-from-credit-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “Remove Collections from credit report” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted March 25, 2024</p>\n<p class=\"note\">He described the charges as unfair and said an attempted small-claims case was dismissed. This is his account of disputed move-out charges, not a finding that he or his friends caused the alleged damage.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 02 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>Bank of Mom &amp; Dad: the expansion pack.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>Introducing Bank of Mom &amp; Dad: because “self-made” sounds better when you leave out the down payment. Mom and Dad supply the capital; three letters—LLC—are apparently interviewing for the job of protecting the family fortune.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/70/topics/1180364-investment-property-without-it-affecting-dti\"><p>“I dont have the upfront cash to purchase another for a down payment but my parents are interested in financing my down payment with a 5% interest rate.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/70/topics/1180364-investment-property-without-it-affecting-dti\"><p>“Is an LLC a secure, 100 % fool proof method to protect my parents assets?”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/70/topics/1180364-investment-property-without-it-affecting-dti\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “Investment property without it affecting DTI” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted March 25, 2024</p>\n<p class=\"note\">The post asks about possible financing structures. It does not establish that the proposed loan closed.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 03 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>Please hold all family-finance reviews.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>Welcome to the advice forum. Please leave the advice in the designated advice-free area.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180572-leverage-investors-credit\"><p>“<strong>My parents have plenty of money</strong> and most of it is sitting in low risk investments such as money market accounts getting 4.5% interest.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180572-leverage-investors-credit\"><p>“Please hold the advice about investing with family members.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180572-leverage-investors-credit\"><p>“I understand everyone has their own opinions and preferences but please hold off judgement.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/49/topics/1180572-leverage-investors-credit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “Leverage Investors Credit” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted March 25, 2024</p>\n<p class=\"note\">In the same post, he requested feedback on loan financing and LLC asset protection while asking readers to withhold advice about investing with relatives.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 04 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>The family home enters the group project.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>Some family group chats plan Thanksgiving. This one appears to have a capital stack.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/51/topics/410916-subject-to---tax-write-off#post_6719862\"><p>“We were exploring taking out a primary mortgage on their home to take out 350k in cash at about a 6% interest rate, and I take out a loan from them at an equal rate or slightly higher (maybe 6.5%).”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/51/topics/410916-subject-to---tax-write-off#post_6719862\"><p>“They are cutting me a good deal and I am grateful.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/51/topics/410916-subject-to---tax-write-off#post_6719862\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “Subject to - tax write off?” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted March 26, 2024</p>\n<p class=\"note\">He described an idea being explored with his parents, not a completed mortgage or purchase.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 05 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>The expertise comes with a preferred return.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>The brochure now offers an executive suite: bring most of the cash and enjoy a complimentary presentation on the value of expertise.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1173079-lp-gp-deal-structure\"><p>“I am providing the industry knowledge and skill behind the investment.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1173079-lp-gp-deal-structure\"><p>“If the investment under performs, I am at fault, and if the investment over performs, I deserve the credit.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1173079-lp-gp-deal-structure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “LP GP deal structure” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted February 19, 2024</p>\n<p class=\"note\">He proposed contributing 20–30% of the upfront investment plus furnishing and management work, and asked whether his preferred profit split was reasonable.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 06 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>Regulations: some assembly required.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>Before choosing your adventure, please locate the instruction manual. The zoning chapter has fewer pool photos.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/86/topics/970179-savannah-georgia-multifamily#post_6425111\"><p>“I&#x27;m looking to invest in a STR in savannah, but I&#x27;m confused with the regulations.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/86/topics/970179-savannah-georgia-multifamily#post_6425111\"><p>“It seems that most areas are not zoned for STR&#x27;s and most permits are taken.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/86/topics/970179-savannah-georgia-multifamily#post_6425111\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “Savannah Georgia multifamily” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted June 20, 2023</p>\n<p class=\"note\">This is a historical forum question about regulations. It does not establish the permit status of any property.</p></article><article class=\"owner-story\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Chapter 07 / BiggerPockets</p><h3>The business plan has a question mark.</h3>\n<p class=\"owner-joke\"><span class=\"editorial-label\">Travel guide commentary</span>Our itinerary includes fourteen days at the house, eighteen months of promotional APR, and one very busy question mark.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-excerpts\"><p class=\"editorial-label\">From the post · Patrick Forelli</p><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1126514-llc-for-funding-2nd-home-loan-str-investment\"><p>“I&#x27;m looking to purchase an airbnb with a 2nd home loan.”</p></blockquote><blockquote cite=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1126514-llc-for-funding-2nd-home-loan-str-investment\"><p>“Is it feasible/ legal to buy the property with a 2nd home loan, occupy the residence for 14 days, create an LLC management company to manage my property on airbnb, and leverage 15k in 0 % interest through business credit cards.”</p></blockquote></div>\n<p class=\"source\"><a href=\"https://www.biggerpockets.com/forums/530/topics/1126514-llc-for-funding-2nd-home-loan-str-investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read “LLC for funding, 2nd home loan STR investment” on BiggerPockets ↗</a> · Posted June 30, 2023</p>\n<p class=\"note\">He asked whether a proposed arrangement was feasible or legal. Forum replies expressed differing views; this page makes no finding about a mortgage or its terms.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"facebook-album\" aria-labelledby=\"owner-heading\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Behind the brochure / The owner edition</div>\n<h2 id=\"owner-heading\">The Facebook photo album</h2>\n<p class=\"intro\">The brochure has a photo album. Meet the Patrick of <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/humansofpatrick/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Humans of Patrick</a>, in the page’s own words.</p>\n<p class=\"note\">Photos and quoted captions below come from the supplied offline copies of the Humans of Patrick Facebook page, saved October 17, 2026. They are presented as the page’s humorous posts, not verified biographical statements or independently authenticated quotations by Patrick Forelli. No affiliation or endorsement is implied.</p>\n<div class=\"owner-gallery\"><figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1720784961492290.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 1\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1720784961492290.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 1\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>Can you guess what Patrick is doing?</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1720784961492290\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1714845775419542.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 2\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1714845775419542.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 2\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>Not much. How about you?</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1714845775419542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1702688723301914.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 3\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1702688723301914.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 3\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>“I’m just working on universal peace and getting everybody to love each other. I’m an official brother man. I’m the one. Well, I’m one of the ones. There are all kinds of brother mans: black, white, Indian. A brother man is somebody who helps when people need help. A brother man will stand up and say: ‘That’s not right.’ A lot of women are brother mans too. But we don’t call them brother mans. We call them sisters. And damn this blanket is soft.”</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1702688723301914\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1702104263360360.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 4\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 4\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1702104263360360.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 4\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>“I’m looking to establish a solid relationship with somebody. But it’s hard for me to imagine it happening. I’m not a kid anymore. I don’t have a home. I don’t have a heck of a lot to offer. Plus it’s been a long time since I’ve had any sort of relationship, so I’ve kind of lost track of how to deal with all that. I work at a sales center so I’m surrounded by people all day, elbow-to-elbow. It’s not so bad then. But then I go home, fix dinner, and bang—it all shuts off. That’s when I realize that I’m not in the situation that I want to be in. And I’m not sure how to get out of it.”</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1702104263360360\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1700679536836166.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 5\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1700679536836166.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 5\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>“I was working as a school safety officer when I met her. She was a teacher. But she kept working her way up. She became a principal. She went to work in the central office. She got her doctorate. Eventually she became the highest-ranking black woman in New York education. She was always taking that next step. I was working as a custodian when we got married. She was making five times more than me. It bothered me at first. It took some counseling to convince me that she hadn’t ‘settled’ for me. I’d been raised on the idea that the man was supposed to provide. But eventually I came around to the idea that money wasn’t the only way to provide. I could support her by doing chores, or taking the kids to school, or picking her up from the airport. Her work benefited all of us, so I could help provide by making her job easier. And eventually she inspired me to want more for myself. She’s the one that convinced me to go back to college.”</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1700679536836166\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"owner-card\">\n<button class=\"image-button\" data-image=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1710564389181014.jpg\" data-caption=\"Humans of Patrick · photo 6\" aria-label=\"Enlarge Humans of Patrick · photo 6\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/owner/photos/facebook-1710564389181014.jpg\" alt=\"Photograph accompanying Humans of Patrick post 6\"></button>\n<figcaption><blockquote>Best wishes for the birthday boy on his big day. Let&#x27;s hope his day is filled with fondling balls like this one.  Like this picture to send some love</blockquote><p class=\"source\">— <cite>Humans of Patrick</cite> · <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1710564389181014\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Original Facebook photo ↗</a></p></figcaption></figure></div></section>";
const A='assets/';
const path=location.pathname;const page=path.includes('about-owner')?'owner':path.includes('bed-bug-bordello')?'whitefield':path.includes('garland-gta')?'garland':'home';
const reviews=[
{name:'Danita',date:'October 7, 2026',score:'1.0',quote:'Reservation was cancelled the day of our arrival due to a pest problem.',context:'The guest says they were already on the way and did not get to stay.'},
{name:'Doris',date:'September 30, 2026',score:'7.0',quote:"I did enjoy my stay and would love to stay again",context:'Also reported a nonworking projector and bites from little black bugs, explicitly saying “Not bedbugs.”'},
{name:'Miyah',date:'September 20, 2026',score:'1.0',quote:'As soon as I walked in i seen roaches.',context:'The supplied review also alleges bedbugs and a nonworking master-bedroom shower. A property-response preview is visible; the full response was not supplied.'},
{name:'Chiquita',date:'September 17, 2026',score:'8.0',quote:'It was plenty of room for my friends and I to be comfortable.',context:'Also reported lock trouble and suspected bedbugs; the guest says a doctor confirmed the bites.'},
{name:'Thanh',date:'September 5, 2026',score:'7.0',quote:'Good location, large space, free parking. But bad smell room, bedbug, small cockroach.',context:'The supplied review includes both positive comments and cleanliness complaints.'},
{name:'Cole',date:'September 2024',score:'2',scale:'5',platform:'Airbnb',image:'garland/2_party_house.png',quote:'Place was noticeably dirty when entering. Entrance hadn’t been vacuumed, sticky stuff on the floor. The couch was ripped, there was wall damage - felt like a party house unsuitable for family stays.',context:'15 years on Airbnb · Rated 2 stars out of 5.'}
];
const videoBase="assets/whitefield/videos/";
const offlineVideos=false;
const youtubeVideos={"airbnb-brawl.mp4": "BuSnI4De5Sk", "bullets-hit-nearby-homes.mp4": "r2nPxOJlNd0", "police-investigation.mp4": "LxeWDLwMIno", "neighbors-react.mp4": "E4NYwe-brgI", "grinder-pump-overflow.mp4": "0qKOywS4RWo", "grinder-pump-august-5.mp4": "USQtHn8AiHo", "guest-notices-pump-failure.mp4": "obECa0K9oss", "nvr-sewer-overlay.mp4": "9YM11YvgE54"};
const videoPlayer=(title,id)=>(offlineVideos||id==='airbnb-brawl.mp4')?`<video controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="${title}" src="${videoBase+(id==='airbnb-brawl.mp4'?'airbnb-brawl-zoomed.mp4?v=91c7d057ceca':id)}"></video>`:`<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/${youtubeVideos[id]}" title="${title}" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>`;
const videoLink=id=>(offlineVideos||id==='airbnb-brawl.mp4')?videoBase+(id==='airbnb-brawl.mp4'?'airbnb-brawl-zoomed.mp4?v=91c7d057ceca':id):'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v='+youtubeVideos[id];

const videos=[["Sunday morning fight", "airbnb-brawl.mp4"], ["Shooting · bullets hit nearby homes", "bullets-hit-nearby-homes.mp4"], ["Shooting · police investigation", "police-investigation.mp4"], ["Shooting · neighbors react", "neighbors-react.mp4"], ["Grinder pump overflow", "grinder-pump-overflow.mp4"], ["Grinder pump still overflowing · August 5, 2026", "grinder-pump-august-5.mp4"], ["Guest notices grinder pump failure", "guest-notices-pump-failure.mp4"], ["NVR footage with sewer overlay", "nvr-sewer-overlay.mp4"]];
const hero=(name,tag,description,img,link,label)=>`<div class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">${tag}</div><h1>${name}</h1><p class="intro">${description}</p><p class="site-context">Independent neighbor commentary on vacation rentals associated with Patrick Forelli in Savannah, GA, including Airbnb and Vrbo guest reviews.</p><a class="button" href="${link}">${label} ↗</a>${page!=='home'?'<button class="share">Copy page link</button>':''}<p class="source">An independent neighbor-created parody. No bookings. Plenty of reading material.</p></div><img class="art" src="${A+img}" alt="Supplied parody artwork for ${name}"></div>`;
const gallery=(files)=>`<div class="gallery">${files.map(([file,caption])=>`<figure><button class="image-button" data-image="${A+file}" data-caption="${caption}"><img loading="lazy" src="${A+file}" alt="${caption}"></button><figcaption>${caption}</figcaption></figure>`).join('')}</div>`;
const propertyPhotos = page==='whitefield' ? [
  ...['','_1','_2','_3','_4'].map((suffix,i)=>['whitefield/property_maintenance_issue_2026-05-09'+suffix+'.jpg','Lawn maintenance photograph '+(i+1)+' · filename dated May 9, 2026']),
  ['whitefield/sanitation_trash_issue_2026-07-08.jpg','Trash photograph · filename dated July 8, 2026']
] : page==='garland' ? [
  ['garland/sanitation_trash_issue_2026-06-18.jpg','Trash photograph 1 · filename dated June 18, 2026'],
  ['garland/sanitation_trash_issue_2026-06-18_1.jpg','Trash photograph 2 · filename dated June 18, 2026']
] : [];
const propertyPhotoSection=()=>`<section id="property-photos"><div class="eyebrow">${page==='whitefield'?'Whitefield':'Garland'} / Property upkeep</div><h2>${page==='whitefield'?'Lawn maintenance and trash.':'The trash photo file.'}</h2><div class="review-shell" id="property-slideshow"><div class="review-top"><span class="eyebrow">Supplied property photographs</span><div class="controls"><button id="photo-prev" aria-label="Previous property photograph">←</button><button id="photo-pause">Pause</button><button id="photo-next" aria-label="Next property photograph">→</button></div></div><figure style="margin:24px 0"><button class="image-button" id="property-photo"><img style="display:block;width:100%;height:430px;object-fit:contain" alt=""></button><figcaption id="property-caption"></figcaption></figure><div class="dots" aria-label="Choose property photograph">${propertyPhotos.map((_,i)=>`<button data-photo-slide="${i}" aria-label="Property photograph ${i+1}"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><p class="note">Photographs supplied by the site creator. Dates above are taken from filenames.</p></section>`;
const reviewSection=()=>`<section id="reviews"><div class="eyebrow">The guest book</div><h2>What guests are saying.</h2><p>Six supplied guest reviews: five from Booking.com and one from Airbnb. Read the praise, the complaints, and the screenshots for yourself.</p><div class="review-shell"><div class="review-top"><span class="eyebrow">Guest reviews · September 2024 & September–October 2026</span><div class="controls"><button id="prev" aria-label="Previous review">←</button><button id="pause">Pause</button><button id="next" aria-label="Next review">→</button></div></div><div id="review-content"></div><div class="dots" aria-label="Choose review">${reviews.map((_,i)=>`<button data-slide="${i}" aria-label="Review ${i+1}"></button>`).join('')}</div></div><details><summary>Read the complete supplied review text</summary><pre id="review-text">Loading supplied text…</pre><a href="assets/whitefield/rev-ew_text_booking_com.txt">Open original text file</a></details><p class="note">Guest statements are reproduced from the supplied files and are not independent pest inspections. The reviews include mixed experiences; Doris explicitly says the bugs were not bedbugs.</p></section>`;
const whitefield=()=>`${hero('Bed Bug<br>Bordello','01 / The Whitefield edition','Come for the getaway.<br>Leave because of the bed bugs.','whitefield/whitefieldbed_bug_bordello.jpg','#reviews','Read the reviews')}<div class="strip"><span>A satirical name</span><span>Real supplied reviews</span><span>A neighbor’s account</span></div>${reviewSection()}<section><div class="eyebrow">Guest-uploaded material</div><h2>The less glamorous photo album.</h2><p class="note">Images supplied in the bedbug-pictures folder. These photographs alone do not establish species or the origin of any marks.</p>${gallery(['735112330.jpg','735112342.jpg','743427130.jpg'].map((f,i)=>['whitefield/bedbug_pictures/'+f,'Supplied guest image '+(i+1)]))}</section>${propertyPhotoSection()}<section id="incidents"><div class="eyebrow">Beyond the listing</div><h2>What the neighbors report.</h2><p>The site creator reports a shooting and damage to their vehicle, lawn, and home. The following photographs and correspondence were supplied with that account.</p>${gallery([['whitefield/shooting/1.jpg','Shooting-related photograph 01'],['whitefield/shooting/2.jpg','Shooting-related photograph 02'],['whitefield/shooting/trunk.jpg','Vehicle trunk · supplied damage photograph'],['whitefield/shooting/muffler.webp','Vehicle muffler · supplied damage photograph']])}<div class="notice"><strong>The insurance correspondence</strong><p>The supplied March 3, 2026 letter records a reported September 14, 2025 shooting loss. It denies host liability, says police did not identify the shooters, and states that the host was not involved. This document is included as correspondence, not as a finding of wrongdoing by the host.</p><details><summary>View the supplied insurance letter</summary>${gallery([['whitefield/shooting/denied_insurance_claim.jpg','Supplied insurance denial letter · March 3, 2026']])}</details></div><h3>The lawn gets a supporting role.</h3><p class="note">Supplied lawn-damage photographs. Dates and causes are not independently established by these images.</p>${gallery([3,4,5].map(i=>['whitefield/lawn_damage/'+i+'.jpg','Lawn-damage photograph '+(i-2)]))}</section><section id="videos"><div class="eyebrow">The neighborhood watch list</div><h2>Not the vacation highlight reel.</h2><p>Shooting footage, a reported fight, grinder-pump overflow, and guest conversations, grouped using the labels in the supplied video file.</p><p class="note">Video players are shown below, or you can open each video on YouTube. Video content and incident labels have not been independently verified.</p><div class="video-grid">${videos.map(([title,id])=>`<article class="video"><h3>${title}</h3><div class="video-screen">${videoPlayer(title,id)}</div><a href="${videoLink(id)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open video ↗</a></article>`).join('')}</div><p><a href="assets/whitefield/youtube_videos.txt">Original video-link file ↗</a></p></section><section><div class="eyebrow">Additional supplied material</div><h2>The party-house file.</h2>${gallery([['whitefield/1_party_house.png','Additional Whitefield party-house material · supplied image']])}</section>`;
const garland=()=>`${hero('Garland GTA','02 / The Garland edition','Same house. Different party.<br>The neighborhood gets the sequel.','garland/garland_gta.jpg','#gallery','Explore the photo file')}<div class="strip"><span>Parody artwork</span><span>Supplied sanitation photos</span><span>The smaller dossier</span></div>${propertyPhotoSection()}<section id="gallery"><div class="eyebrow">The morning after</div><h2>Leave only memories.<br>And apparently a lot of trash.</h2><p>The supplied Garland folder contains parody artwork, a party-house image, and two sanitation photographs with June 18, 2026 in their filenames.</p>${gallery([['garland/1_party_house.png','Additional Garland party-house material · supplied image'],['garland/sanitation_trash_issue_2026-06-18.jpg','Sanitation photograph 01 · filename dated June 18, 2026'],['garland/sanitation_trash_issue_2026-06-18_1.jpg','Sanitation photograph 02 · filename dated June 18, 2026']])}<p class="note">No Garland review text or incident videos were supplied. The dramatic scenes and slogans in the Garland GTA illustration are parody, not documentary photographs or verified incident claims.</p></section>`;
const home=()=>`${hero('Wish you<br>weren’t here.','The neighbor’s travel guide','Two rentals. One neighborhood.<br>A satirical travel guide to the other side of the vacation brochure.','whitefield/whitefieldbed_bug_bordello.jpg','#properties','Choose your adventure')}<div class="strip"><span>Independent neighborhood parody</span><span>Guest reviews & supplied documentation</span><span>No reservations accepted</span></div><section id="properties"><div class="eyebrow">Our carefully uncurated collection</div><h2>Pick your plot twist.</h2><div class="grid"><article class="property"><a href="bed-bug-bordello.html"><img src="${A}whitefield/whitefieldbed_bug_bordello.jpg" alt="Bed Bug Bordello parody artwork"></a><p class="number">01 / WHITEFIELD</p><h3>Bed Bug Bordello</h3><p>A guest book with a storyline. Browse six reviews, supplied damage photos, insurance correspondence, and eight video links.</p><a class="button" href="bed-bug-bordello.html">Read the full story ↗</a></article><article class="property"><a href="garland-gta.html"><img src="${A}garland/garland_gta.jpg" alt="Garland GTA parody artwork"></a><p class="number">02 / GARLAND</p><h3>Garland GTA</h3><p>Same house. Different party. A shorter photo-led edition featuring the supplied artwork and sanitation material.</p><a class="button" href="garland-gta.html">Explore Garland GTA ↗</a></article></div></section><section><div class="eyebrow">Behind the brochure</div><h2>A joke with a paper trail.</h2><p class="intro">This is a neighbor’s parody project about the experience of living beside short-term rentals. The nicknames and travel-brochure copy are satire; the guest reviews and documentation are presented with their sources and limits.</p><p class="note">Neither page is a rental listing. This project is not affiliated with Airbnb, Booking.com, any property owner, or the Grand Theft Auto franchise. Parody illustrations should not be mistaken for photographs of actual events.</p></section>`;
document.title={"owner":"About the owner | Patrick Forelli · The Neighbor’s Travel Guide","home": "Patrick Forelli Vacation Rentals | Savannah GA Airbnb & Vrbo", "whitefield": "Bed Bug Bordello | Patrick Forelli, Savannah GA Rental Reviews", "garland": "Garland GTA | Patrick Forelli, Savannah GA Vacation Rentals"}[page];
document.querySelector('#app').innerHTML=`<header><a class="brand" href="index.html">The Neighbor’s <span>Travel Guide.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="index.html">The collection</a><a href="bed-bug-bordello.html">Whitefield</a><a href="garland-gta.html">Garland</a><a href="about-owner.html">About the owner</a></nav></header><main>${page==='owner'?ownerSection():page==='home'?home():page==='whitefield'?whitefield():garland()}</main><footer><strong>Satire up front. Sources underneath.</strong><p>Independent neighbor-created commentary. Reports and reviews reflect their stated sources; disputed claims are not findings of liability. Parody names and illustrations are creative material. No affiliation or endorsement is implied.</p><nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Related pages">${page==='whitefield'?'<a href="garland-gta.html">Visit Garland GTA ↗</a>':page==='garland'?'<a href="bed-bug-bordello.html">Visit Bed Bug Bordello ↗</a>':''}<a href="https://michaelwoodc.github.io/stvr-info-page/owners/cozy_corner_rentals/cozy_corner_rentals.html">Cozy Corner Rentals info page ↗</a><a href="about-owner.html">About the owner</a><a href="index.html">Back to the collection ↑</a></nav></footer>`;
let slide=0,playing=!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
function renderReview(){const r=reviews[slide];document.querySelector('#review-content').innerHTML=`<div class="review"><button class="image-button" data-image="${A+(r.image||`whitefield/review_${slide+1}.png`)}" data-caption="${r.name} · supplied ${r.platform||'Booking.com'} review"><img src="${A+(r.image||`whitefield/review_${slide+1}.png`)}" alt="Supplied review screenshot ${slide+1}, ${r.name}"></button><div><span class="eyebrow">${r.score} / ${r.scale||'10'} · ${r.name}</span><blockquote>“${r.quote}”</blockquote><p>${r.context}</p><p class="source">${r.platform||'Booking.com'} · Reviewed ${r.date}<br>Screenshot ${slide+1} of ${reviews.length} · Click to enlarge</p></div></div>`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]').forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('active',i===slide));document.querySelector('#pause').textContent=playing?'Pause':'Play';}
if(page==='whitefield'){const timer=createSlideshowTimer(document.querySelector('.review-shell'),()=>{slide=(slide+1)%reviews.length;renderReview()},()=>playing);renderReview();document.querySelector('#prev').onclick=()=>{slide=(slide-1+reviews.length)%reviews.length;renderReview();timer.reset()};document.querySelector('#next').onclick=()=>{slide=(slide+1)%reviews.length;renderReview();timer.reset()};document.querySelector('#pause').onclick=()=>{playing=!playing;renderReview();timer.reset()};document.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]').forEach(el=>el.onclick=()=>{slide=Number(el.dataset.slide);renderReview();timer.reset()});fetch(A+'whitefield/rev-ew_text_booking_com.txt').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error();return r.text()}).then(t=>document.querySelector('#review-text').textContent=t+'\n\nCole\n15 years on Airbnb\nRating: 2 stars out of 5\nSeptember 2024\n'+reviews[reviews.length-1].quote).catch(()=>document.querySelector('#review-text').textContent='Use the original text-file link below to read the supplied reviews.');}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-image]');if(el){const d=document.querySelector('#viewer');d.querySelector('img').src=el.dataset.image;d.querySelector('img').alt=el.dataset.caption;d.querySelector('p').textContent=el.dataset.caption;d.showModal()}});
document.querySelector('.close').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#viewer').close();document.querySelector('#viewer').addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===e.currentTarget)e.currentTarget.close()});document.querySelector('.share')?.addEventListener('click',async e=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(location.href);e.target.textContent='Link copied ✓'}catch{e.target.textContent='Copy this page’s address from your browser'}});

if(propertyPhotos.length){
  let photoSlide=0,photoPlaying=!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  const shell=document.querySelector('#property-slideshow');
  function renderPhoto(){
    const [file,caption]=propertyPhotos[photoSlide];
    const button=shell.querySelector('#property-photo');
    button.dataset.image=A+file;button.dataset.caption=caption;
    button.querySelector('img').src=A+file;button.querySelector('img').alt=caption;
    shell.querySelector('#property-caption').textContent=caption+' · '+(photoSlide+1)+' of '+propertyPhotos.length+' · Click to enlarge';
    shell.querySelector('#photo-pause').textContent=photoPlaying?'Pause':'Play';
    shell.querySelectorAll('[data-photo-slide]').forEach((el,i)=>el.classList.toggle('active',i===photoSlide));
  }
  const photoTimer=createSlideshowTimer(shell,()=>{photoSlide=(photoSlide+1)%propertyPhotos.length;renderPhoto()},()=>photoPlaying);
  const changePhoto=i=>{photoSlide=(i+propertyPhotos.length)%propertyPhotos.length;renderPhoto();photoTimer.reset()};
  shell.querySelector('#photo-prev').onclick=()=>changePhoto(photoSlide-1);
  shell.querySelector('#photo-next').onclick=()=>changePhoto(photoSlide+1);
  shell.querySelector('#photo-pause').onclick=()=>{photoPlaying=!photoPlaying;renderPhoto();photoTimer.reset()};
  shell.querySelectorAll('[data-photo-slide]').forEach(el=>el.onclick=()=>changePhoto(Number(el.dataset.photoSlide)));
  renderPhoto();
}